    <title>Facets</title>
    <link type="text/html" rel="alternate" href="https://stpeter.im/journal/2076.html"/>
    <id>tag:stpeter.im,2076</id>
    <issued>2026-10-09</issued>
    <modified>2026-10-09</modified>
    <summary>Two weeks ago today, some friends and I held a celebration of life at the Denver Botanic Gardens for my dear departed Elisa. I waited quite a while to schedule this gathering because Elisa never liked it when other people held such events too close in time to someone's passing. Everyone I've spoken with since then has commented on how beautiful the gathering was; if you ask me, that's because so many beautiful people were there to remember Elisa....</summary>
  </entry>
